                "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong>Windows Vista (Does not support Windows XP)<br>\t</li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>Intel Dual Core 1.8GHz (or higher) or AMD Athlon II X2 (or higher)<br>\t</li><li><strong>Memory:</strong>1 GB RAM<br>\t</li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>nVidia GF6600 (or higher) or ATi X1600 (or higher) with 256MB of RAM<br>\t</li><li><strong>DirectX®:</strong>11<br>\t</li><li><strong>Hard Drive:</strong>350 MB HD space<br>\t</li><li><strong>Sound:</strong>DirectSound compatible, DirectX 9.0c (or higher) compatible<br>\t</li><li><strong>Other Requirements:</strong>Broadband Internet connection<br>\t</li><li><strong>Additional:</strong>DirectX 11/Shader3.0 or higher</li></ul>",
